The zmanim directory is imported from http://code.google.com/p/zmanim-framework/ by using svn:externals.

	1. In this directory, run the following command:
		svn propedit svn:externals .

	2. In the resulting editor, enter the following, which are in the form (1) local subdirectory; 
		(2) [OPTIONAL] revision of the remote sources; (3) location of the remote sources:
		zmanim -r8 http://zmanim-framework.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/Java

	3. svn update


The kosherjava directory is imported in a similar fashion from http://kosherjava.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/
